| Layer Number | Layer Name   | Main Function                                         | Example Protocols and Standards           |
| ------------ | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Layer 7      | Application  | Providing services and interfaces to applications     | HTTP, HTTPS, FTP, SMTP, DNS               |
| Layer 6      | Presentation | Data encoding, encryption, and compression            | Unicode, SSL/TLS, JPEG, PNG, MPEG         |
| Layer 5      | Session      | Establishing, maintaining, and synchronising sessions | NFS, RPC, NetBIOS                         |
